Phase-50 / Prompt 0048 — S7 State-machine debugger narrator
============================================================

Feature ID:        state-machine-debugger-narrator
Registry tier:     S7 (LLM-backed user-visible feature)
DefaultOn:         false
Backend route:     POST /api/v1/ai/system/fsm/narrate
Frontend anchor:   /system/fsm-debugger (registry coverage anchor;
                   actual SPA route is /state-debugger — the AI
                   surface is rendered inside the existing
                   StateMachineDebuggerPage at that route)
UI test ID:        ai-feature-state-machine-debugger-narrator-root
Allowed tools:     query_fsm_trace, retrieve_fsm_chunks
Retrieval types:   fsm_transition, signal_history_summary
Redaction policy:  PolicyDigest (Allow=[ClassVehicleName])
Render contract:   narrative (AiOutputPanel streams the SSE delta
                   text into the AIFeatureCard scaffold; no typed
                   proposal preview because the narrator never
                   mutates FSM state, transition rows, or any
                   signal-pipeline entry point — ADR-015 §I8
                   propose-only).

