Substitution note: the slice prompt's command was
`make ai-eval-fast --feature state-machine-debugger-narrator`,
but the project's Makefile target invokes `go run ./cmd/ai-eval --all`
and does not forward per-feature flags. The CLI binary supports
`--feature <id>` directly, so running it that way is the
